
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Read Notes</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: #f7f7f5;
            color: #111;
            font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
            padding: 50px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        /* Header */

        .header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: end;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #111;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .header p {
            color: #777;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* Notes */

        .notes {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }

        /* Note Card */

        .note-card {
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 28px;
            min-height: 200px;
            transition: 0.25s ease;
        }

        .note-card:hover {
            border-color: #111;
            transform: translateY(-4px);
        }

        .note-card h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .note-card h3 {
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #888;
            margin-bottom: 7px;
        }

        .note-card p {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #444;
        }

        /* Responsive */

        @media (max-width: 650px) {

            body {
                padding: 30px 15px;
            }

            .header {
                align-items: flex-start;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 8px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }

            .notes {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <main class="container">

        <header class="header">
            <h1>My Notes.</h1>
            <p>Thoughts worth keeping.</p>
        </header>


        <section class="notes">

            <!-- Note 1 -->

            <article class="note-card">

                <h3>Title</h3>
                <h2>Learning JavaScript</h2>

                <h3>Description</h3>
                <p>
                    Today I learned about functions, arrays,
                    objects and how JavaScript works with the DOM.
                </p>

            </article>


            <!-- Note 2 -->

            <article class="note-card">

                <h3>Title</h3>
                <h2>My Project Idea</h2>

                <h3>Description</h3>
                <p>
                    I want to build a simple notes application
                    using HTML, CSS, JavaScript and localStorage.
                </p>

            </article>


            <!-- Note 3 -->

            <article class="note-card">

                <h3>Title</h3>
                <h2>Things To Learn</h2>

                <h3>Description</h3>
                <p>
                    Practice JavaScript DOM manipulation,
                    APIs, localStorage and asynchronous JavaScript.
                </p>

            </article>


            <!-- Note 4 -->

            <article class="note-card">

                <h3>Title</h3>
                <h2>Weekend Plans</h2>

                <h3>Description</h3>
                <p>
                    Finish the notes project, push it to GitHub
                    and start working on the next JavaScript project.
                </p>

            </article>

        </section>

    </main>

</body>
</html>
```
